MODULE: CallerOnlyAfterTerminalsEarlyCompletion
TARGET: CallerOnlyAfterTerminals
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: The decision is reported as caller completion before terminals.
PERTURBS: TerminalOpportunity
--- FIND
    /\ (Terminal \/ Checkpoint \/ Complete \/ TerminalIdle)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: acknowledge a decided saga without delivery.
    /\ (Terminal \/ Checkpoint \/ Complete \/ TerminalIdle
        \/ (saga = "decided" /\ saga' = "idle" /\ completed' = TRUE
            /\ UNCHANGED <<drained, materialised, checkpointed, terminalWitness>>))
--- END
